# Cargo output, at any depth: the root crate, unixlib/, probe/, alsa-plugin/.
# Anchoring these per crate means every new crate needs editing here, and forgetting
# is silent — the build directory gets committed.
target/

# Built artifacts. Both are produced by scripts/ and belong in a payload, not in
# the repository.
dist/

# alsa-plugin/ intermediate output: the C shim's object file, the tone test binary,
# and the linker wrapper the build uses to inspect its own link line.
alsa-plugin/build/

# Libraries the plugin links against, none of which may be committed:
#   libasound.so.2  — the stub build.sh generates from shim/libasound-stub.c
#   real/           — a copy of the container's own libasound, taken from the image
#                     to link the tone test against an ABI that matches the device
alsa-plugin/prebuilt/

.idea
*.iml
.vscode/

*.rs.bk
*.orig
*.rej
.staticlib/
